<p>The mittens work nicely. I'd ditch the second interview and keep the first; the second is pretty redundant. I also echo Anqxyr's point about excessive expungement. A case of necrotizing fasciitis, for example, isn't something the Foundation would classify, nor is it too disgusting for this site's readership. Go ahead and put it in.</p>
